50
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:49,520
Wow !

51
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:52,480
An artifact made from a Soul Formation's life artifact !

52
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,640
Congratulations, Master.

53
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:57,960
This poison sword

54
00:06:58,280 --> 00:07:00,880
