55
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,120
It would leave them at death's door !

56
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,160
So what if it has many underlings ?

57
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:22,400
What's so great about you ?

58
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:24,520
I'll get some underlings very soon too !

59
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:38,400
