Bridge of No Return

62
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:55,560
Earth Trial: Bridge of No Return\N\NI have passed through the Earth Trial and killed its king before reaching this Road of No Return. This place is very interesting, if anyone in the future sees this, then consider it fate.\N\NCarefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.

63
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,440
No Return ?

64
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,800
Carefully ponder the meaning of 'No Return'.

65
