107
00:11:17,960 --> 00:11:18,760
Tie Zhu...

108
00:11:19,320 --> 00:11:20,720
Save your father !

109
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:21,520
Tie Zhu !

110
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:24,080
