117
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,520
Tie Zhu...

118
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:55,240
Even facing death, my parents never crushed the Divine Sense Bead.

119
00:11:53,840 --> 00:11:54,840
Tie Zhu...

120
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,160
I beg you !

121
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,480
They're not my parents.

122
00:11:58,680 --> 00:12:01,120
