139
00:13:58,120 --> 00:13:59,920
You're lucky for having me

140
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,720
protect you all the way up here.

141
00:14:31,960 --> 00:14:34,120
The core of this Ancient God's restriction

142
00:14:34,120 --> 00:14:35,880
is indeed beautiful.

143
00:15:08,480 --> 00:15:09,280
Master,

144
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:11,640
Yi'er did not fail you.

145
00:15:11,760 --> 00:15:13,200
I diligently studied restrictions

146
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,120
during the past 1000 years.

147
00:15:15,000 --> 00:15:19,960
1000 years ago

148
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:20,360
Yi'er,

149
00:15:21,240 --> 00:15:22,600
watch carefully.

150
00:15:33,600 --> 00:15:35,040
This is a restriction.

151
00:15:35,960 --> 00:15:36,840
The second trial

152
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,920
is called Restriction Mountain.

153
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:41,920
The mountain is covered in restrictions.

154
00:15:44,680 --> 00:15:45,480
Master,

155
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,120
this restriction

156
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:50,040
looks somewhat similar to a formation.

157
00:15:50,320 --> 00:15:51,120
Correct.

158
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:54,080
A restriction is a type of formation

159
00:15:54,960 --> 00:15:56,920
but way more flexible.

160
00:15:57,400 --> 00:15:59,600
They can bend according to the cultivator's will

161
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:01,160
in an infinite number of ways.

162
00:16:01,160 --> 00:16:03,840
Restrictions are more like Divine Sense in a way.

163
00:16:04,760 --> 00:16:06,800
A powerful cultivator can place restrictions

164
00:16:07,160 --> 00:16:08,880
just with their Divine Sense.

165
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,840
As long as that Divine Sense remains,

166
00:16:11,160 --> 00:16:14,080
the restriction will continue to operate.

167
00:16:15,800 --> 00:16:18,240
The simplest way to break a restriction

168
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,120
is to use brute force.

169
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:23,640
But this method requires having a high cultivation.

170
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,840
The higher you climb,

171
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,120
the more complex and powerful

172
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:31,040
the restrictions become.

173
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:34,080
The second method to break restrictions

174
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,600
is to study them.

175
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:39,640
Once you understand the principles and rules

176
00:16:39,640 --> 00:16:41,560
of how a restriction operates,

177
00:16:42,560 --> 00:16:45,120
you can naturally break it.

178
00:16:45,360 --> 00:16:46,160
Master,

179
00:16:46,960 --> 00:16:48,680
