180
00:16:48,840 --> 00:16:50,840
your unfulfilled dream.

181
00:17:08,120 --> 00:17:10,000
Since I modified the restrictions,

182
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:12,000
no one

183
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,920
