186
00:17:56,590 --> 00:18:02,470
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

187
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:09,990
Forever lock away the scars

188
00:18:07,390 --> 00:18:09,990
of this mortal life.

189
00:18:10,250 --> 00:18:16,510
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

190
00:18:17,150 --> 00:18:24,230
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

191
00:18:19,830 --> 00:18:24,230
