196
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:38,670
to let the rain fall in.

197
00:18:38,670 --> 00:18:40,670
I will refine the world

198
00:18:40,750 --> 00:18:43,190
to make our palm lines say

199
00:18:43,390 --> 00:18:45,550
that we will live forever.

200
00:18:45,550 --> 00:18:48,470
Walking off the beaten path

201
00:18:48,470 --> 00:18:51,550
