208
00:19:14,190 --> 00:19:16,870
To overturn this fate,

209
00:19:16,870 --> 00:19:21,230
I will walk against the heavens.

210
00:19:21,670 --> 00:19:28,390
I will even gather the clouds

211
00:19:24,190 --> 00:19:28,390
