212
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:32,630
All this sadness was not meaningless.

213
00:19:32,630 --> 00:19:35,950
How many lives and deaths\Nhave passed in the blink of an eye ?

214
00:19:35,950 --> 00:19:41,750
I vow to break

215
00:19:38,190 --> 00:19:41,750
this chess game of fate.

